# Keep editorial

When writing or revising book contents for this relationship reader, follow **only**:

- [docs/love_relationships_intimacy_editorial_style_guide.md](docs/love_relationships_intimacy_editorial_style_guide.md)
- [docs/250_canonical_books_on_love_relationships_intimacy.md](docs/250_canonical_books_on_love_relationships_intimacy.md)

Do **not** use anything under `docs/_parked/`. Do not apply the parked 12-year-old gloss, anti-doubling, no-invented-image, or Yan Fu 信达雅 SOP.

Navigation, badges, spines (DURATION / THEME), and footer chrome stay **English only**. Chinese belongs on editorial content only.

Catalog storage stays `books.js` (`window.BOOKS` object literals). The style guide’s JSON schema is the field contract; emit it as JavaScript, not a `.json` file.
